(:adr
  :id "D57"
  :shortcode "D57"
  :title "Semantic Subword Architecture and Morpheme-Aligned Identifiers"
  :status :active
  :date "2026-09-10"
  :cluster "architecture/token-efficiency"
  :deciders ["architect" "planner" "implementer" "auditor"]
  :problem "Numeric dash suffixes in task identifiers (such as T412-1, T412-2) impose an unnecessary BPE punctuation penalty, forcing tokenizers to allocate dedicated tokens for hyphens while providing zero functional semantic information in dependency DAGs. When an autonomous agent evaluates an execution array like :dependsOn [T412-1 T412-2], its attention mechanism cannot infer the functional purpose of prerequisite tasks without cross-referencing task tables, causing attention dispersion and context bloat."
  :drivers [
    "BPE Punctuation Elimination: Replace punctuation delimiters with capital subword transitions to merge tokens naturally in cl100k/o200k tokenizers"
    "Semantic Grounding in Dependency Arrays: Encode domain purpose directly into task IDs (T412Audit, T412Codec, T412Sagas, T412Health)"
    "Zero Path Collisions: Alphanumeric subwords avoid directory nesting in git refs, URLs, and filesystem paths caused by slashes"
    "Canonical 30-Morpheme Standard: Standardize a controlled vocabulary of single-token morphemes across all agent tools and plans"
    "Subword-Aware Code Health Auditing: Continuous measurement of SubwordEfficiencyRatio in intel/health to block punctuation token penalties"
  ]
  :decision "Adopt the Semantic Subword Architecture monorepo-wide as Pillar V of Token Conventions. Prohibit numeric dash suffixes in new task collections in favor of canonical capitalized morphemes (Audit, Codec, Sagas, Health, Triggers, Settle). Implement the Subword Token Analyzer in intel/src/health.asl, align all phase task DAGs, and verify full consistency via asl audit consistency."
  :invariants ["C1" "C2" "C3" "C4" "C5" "D34" "D51" "D52" "D56" "D57"]
  :tasks [
    "T413Spec"
    "T413Linter"
    "T413Tasks"
    "T413Grammar"
    "T413Settle"
  ]
  :outcomes [
    "Eradicates uninformative numeric dash suffixes across active task collections"
    "Embeds functional semantics directly into dependency graphs, improving agent attention grounding"
    "Automates detection of punctuation token penalties via 5D health matrix"
    "100% adherence to pure ASL verification gates and D52 consistency standards"
  ]
  :consequences [
    (:pos "Reduces task reference token costs by 25-33% across all prompt contexts")
    (:pos "Improves agent reasoning accuracy by embedding self-documenting semantics into task IDs")
    (:pos "Guarantees zero path collisions in git branches, URLs, and filesystem task stores")
    (:neg "Requires planners to select standard morphemes from the canonical 30-word registry")
  ])